00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:56.050
- Like Apopolis.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:58.710
- Oh, no, not Francois.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:00.000
- Of course that's why he kept me

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:04.160
No, Pam, he couldn't! Francois isn't a killer. Besides, he's not married.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.160
No?

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:09.720
I can't believe it.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:13.810
You're thinking of his cooking. Of course he's married now, but I know who, too.

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.810
To whom?

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:15.730
Who?

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:18.590
Margaret. Whom else?

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:19.590
Who else?

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:20.540
Oh, no, Pam.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:24.930
And I'll bet if someone were to look in his room, they'd find a marriage license.

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:25.930
Pam, you wouldn't.

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:30.000
And the license would be made out to Francois and Margaret, too.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.050
My darling wife, will you please stop this?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.450
For one thing, you're completely wrong,

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.550
and for another, it's none of your...

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:36.100
- What do you know?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.030
- Well, it's just a, that is it?

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.460
- Uh-huh.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.330
- Hey, what's the matter with her?

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.780
- I gave her a sedative.

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.180
- Well, I'm not through questioning her yet.

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.080
You're through.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.880
- Hey, now look here, I'm the deputy sheriff around here.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.080
Only for you.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:52.040
- Yeah?

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.540
Well, it's mighty suspicious you putting her to sleep

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.240
before I finish questioning her.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.960
- Why don't you relax, sonny?

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:08.930
- Sonny, huh.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:12.420
- John, you searched my room this afternoon.

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:14.260
- Well, Maggie, I didn't.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.830
- Didn't need to bother, I'd have shown them to you.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:17.670
- Maggie, I--

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:20.680
- Don't lie to me, I know you were here.

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:22.290
- Well, what's the difference?

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:25.730
Oh, look, Maggie, let's not fight.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.710
Oh, sweetheart, I, I love you so, I,

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:36.210
Take this ring. We'll be married whenever you say so.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:39.530
It's very pretty and very expensive.

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.600
