00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:37.050
- What's happened? - Oh, don't worry, don't worry.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.050
It's nothing, my little pigeon.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:41.850
Oh, don't you worry, now you leave everything to Francois.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:42.850
Or next time?

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:48.080
You know, Seraph, you've been working pretty hard.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.000
I think it would be very much nice you have a little French tapestry.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.000
- No, don't mind for dew. - Agnes!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.080
Bring me, Seraph, a glass of milk.

